  "Spada dell'Alba <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and increase Shoki's Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns.\\nGrant Shoki $4 <link=\"s|281\"><u>[Night's Blessing]</u></link> stacks, if he is below $5 HP, grant $6 bonus <link=\"s|281\"><u>[Night's Blessing]</u></link> stacks.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Blade as sharp as the glimmer before dawn, tears through the deep veil of night, mercilessly sweeping across the enemy's body, delivering an inevitable end and dealing Bless damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=24>Giuramento Incrollabile Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=24>Giuramento Incrollabile <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Gain a Shield equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $4 turns (up to $3 of Shoki's Max HP per skill). Gain $5 [Night's Contract] stack. \\n[Night's Contract]: Increase DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>, when using [Ti Inciderò il Nome Mio], spend all [Night's Contract] to increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link>. Stacks up to $7 times. After using this skill, Shoki can use other skills, this doesn't count as a Persona skill.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Offering blood and drawing power in a devout ritual, the devotee is granted fleeting shelter and the cost of life is etched into this very radiance.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=23>Ti Inciderò il Nome Mio Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=23>Ti Inciderò il Nome Mio <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. If Shoki has $2 or more [Night's Blessing] stacks, deal bonus Bless damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. Increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $4 per <link=\"s|282\"><u>[Night's Contract]</u></link> stack.\\nLose all <link=\"s|282\"><u>[Night's Contract]</u></link> after using this skill, and restore HP by $5 of Shoki's Max HP per [Night's Blessing] stack.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The moment the name is inscribed, the power of the contract is unlocked. A supreme law carves an irreversible mark upon the foes' soul, leaving their sins with nowhere to hide.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, increase damage based on missing HP (up to $3 damage at $2 HP).\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Bless damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "Increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> based on the number of <link=\"s|281\"><u>[Night's Blessing]</u></link> stacks.": "",
  "Increase ATK by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> based on the number of <link=\"s|281\"><u>[Night's Blessing]</u></link> stacks.": "",
  "Increase Pierce based on missing HP (up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Pierce at $1 HP).": "",
  "Increase Pierce based on missing HP (up to <color=#0169ca>$2</color> Pierce at $1 HP).": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>Night's Blessing</color>": "",
  "When Shoki gains Blessing, convert it into [Night's Blessing]: This counts as Blessing, at the end of turn, gain a Shield for $1 turns. Stacks up to $2 times. Shield from this effect lasts for $3 turns.": "",
