  "Star in the Night": "",
  "In battle, Shoki can spend HP to gain [Night's Contract] and increase [Ti Inciderò il Nome Mio] Skill Damage.\\nWhen Shoki gains <link=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link>, convert it into [Night's Blessing]: This counts as Blessing, at the end of turn, gain a Shield equal to $1 of Shoki's Max HP for $3 turns. Stacks up to $2 times. Shield from this effect lasts for $4 turns.": "",
  "Shooting Star's Guidance": "",
  "At the start of battle, Shoki gains [Eternal Star Shine]: Survive fatal damage 1 time and spend [Eternal Star Shine] to recover $1 of Shoki's Max HP (at least recover to 1 HP). Also, increase ATK by $2 for $3 turn.\\nWhen Shoki has [Eternal Star Shine], he can spend HP to below 0 by using [Giuramento Incrollabile], after spending [Eternal Star Shine] from this method, he can gain $4 <link=\"s|282\"><u>[Night's Contract]</u></link> stacks above the maximum limit for this turn.\\nWhen Shoki gains <link=\"s|282\"><u>[Night's Contract]</u></link>, increase Crit Rate by $5 for $6 turns. Stacks up to $7 times.": "",
  "With My Flesh and Bone": "",
  "Decrease the HP cost of [Giuramento Incrollabile] by $1. Increase the maximum number of <link=\"s|282\"><u>[Night's Contract]</u></link> stacks by $2.": "",
  "Fight against Fate": "",
  "Commitment to Honesty": "",
  "Illuminating {{A}}": "",
