  "Deal Bless damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and increase Shoki's Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns.\\nGrant Shoki $4 <link=\"s|281\"><u>[Night's Blessing]</u></link> stacks, if he is below $5 HP, grant $6 bonus <link=\"s|281\"><u>[Night's Blessing]</u></link> stacks.": "",
